// HZM coop - "give all" weapon list (read by the engine GiveCheat when a player runs "give all").
// Overrides the base list so the DEBUG "Give All Guns" key hands you EVERY gun at once - the engine holds
// multiple per category, so you just scroll through them all with the weapon wheel / number keys.
// GUNS ONLY (no grenades/smoke/mines). Format: weapon weapons/<file>.tik

